**This added [["Coward!"]] (elite), [[Leviathan's Sweep]], [[Sprint]], [[Standing Slash]], and [["Watch Yourself!"]], and removed [[Dragon Slash]] (elite), [[Hamstring]], and [[Protector's Defense]] from his skills. 

